        "statement": "Stability Networks is a Microsoft-focused MSP that builds and deploys Microsoft 365, SharePoint, Power Platform, and Copilot Studio solutions.",
        "label": "fact",
        "sourceUrl": "https://stabilitynetworks.com/microsoft-power-platform/",
        "quote": "Microsoft-certified experts in governance, security, and solution architecture"
      }
    },
    {
      "product": "Cloudflare & Google Tag Manager",
      "purpose": "Web security, email address obfuscation, CDN/analytics, and tag management",
