  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "Stability Networks (Stability Networks, Inc.) is an established Managed Service Provider (200+ customers, 8,000+ monitored devices) that already uses HaloPSA and HubSpot internally and actively sells workflow automation, SharePoint development, Microsoft Power Platform, and Microsoft Copilot Studio AI agent consulting to its own clients. They already own the necessary enterprise tools and employ certified engineers to build automations, making them a peer/competitor in automation delivery rather than a prospect for ForgeX's fixed-price SMB catalog."
